181
00:44:23,520 --> 00:44:25,210
Boss believed in my potential, even when I often didn't believe in myself.

182
00:44:25,210 --> 00:44:37,240
Our company was supposed to go under. But it isn't going under anymore, Boss.

183
00:44:37,240 --> 00:44:46,160
Before...

184
00:44:46,160 --> 00:44:50,440
I used to compare myself to people on social media, thinking I wasn't talented enough or good enough, until I lost who I was.

185
00:44:53,480 --> 00:45:01,960
Until one day, someone told me... that I was the strongest duck.

186
00:45:01,960 --> 00:45:11,950
That's why I'm so happy.

187
00:45:11,950 --> 00:45:21,050
But the world can be cruel, because the truth is, this duck wasn't strong enough.

188
00:45:21,050 --> 00:45:27,400
Strong enough to fight this world. So I went back to the place where I grew up, and saw my childhood smile again.

189
00:45:28,040 --> 00:45:33,640
It taught me what happiness feels like when you learn to see your own worth. And I want to tell everyone...

190
00:45:35,960 --> 00:45:46,250
Every star can shine.

191
00:45:46,250 --> 00:45:54,880
It only depends on when the sky is ready to welcome that star.

192
00:45:57,360 --> 00:46:18,600
I hope you'll give my stars a chance to shine in your sky too.

193
00:46:31,400 --> 00:46:38,400
And this is Ahh Wolf! Let's give them a huge round of applause! [Cheers] You did amazing!

194
00:46:42,720 --> 00:46:54,160
Ahh Wolf [Cheers]

195
00:46:54,160 --> 00:47:00,640
Why are you smiling? I came to collect on your promise. Promise?

196
00:47:03,960 --> 00:47:12,200
The promise after the show.

197
00:47:13,120 --> 00:47:22,700
Hey, can I ask you something? I've noticed how attached Jeng is to this bag.

198
00:47:22,700 --> 00:47:33,390
What makes it special? You want to know?

199
00:47:33,390 --> 00:47:43,800
Hey! It has my encouragement inside. You still kept it?

200
00:47:44,040 --> 00:47:54,450
Congratulations, my friend. Congratulations. Flowers—I bought them for you. Thank you. Okay. Thank you, thank you very much.

201
00:47:54,450 --> 00:48:01,360
Oh, my friend, I came today. Are you? Oh, this is my friend.

202
00:48:06,800 --> 00:48:15,880
Pay attention to me. I came here today to say sorry to you.

203
00:48:16,540 --> 00:48:28,470
For teasing you in the past. Now I understand. The world has moved on—whoever loves whoever, it's all free. Life in the fast lane, bro.

204
00:48:28,470 --> 00:48:32,930
What does that mean? I don't know. I asked ChatGPT.

205
00:48:41,480 --> 00:48:51,000
Yo, yo! What's up, my brother? What's my name? My name is... who? No, that's not it. I'm Japanese. Hey, you know him? You know me?

206
00:48:51,000 --> 00:48:57,760
Yeah, I know you, my brother. Oh, my brother.

207
00:49:01,240 --> 00:49:08,120
I think Cutter has finally found his ancestor. So that's what happens when two people with passion meet.

208
00:49:08,120 --> 00:49:36,320
[You Eat Bitter Melon? - Dome Phemadech]
